{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e74f88b7e27fbc4ebf856f9b6a0866d8e64c6be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair A=(5,0), B=(7,0), C=(10,0), D=(13,0), E=(16,0); pair F=(4,3), G=(5,3), H=(7,3), I=(10,3), J=(12,3); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(E); dot(F); dot(G); dot(H); dot(I); dot(J); draw((0,0)--(18,0)^^(0,3)--(18,3)); draw((0,0)--(0,.5)^^(5,0)--(5,.5)^^(10,0)--(10,.5)^^(15,0)--(15,.5)); draw((0,3)--(0,2.5)^^(5,3)--(5,2.5)^^(10,3)--(10,2.5)^^(15,3)--(15,2.5)); draw((1,0)--(1,.2)^^(2,0)--(2,.2)^^(3,0)--(3,.2)^^(4,0)--(4,.2)^^(6,0)--(6,.2)^^(7,0)--(7,.2)^^(8,0)--(8,.2)^^(9,0)--(9,.2)^^(10,0)--(10,.2)^^(11,0)--(11,.2)^^(12,0)--(12,.2)^^(13,0)--(13,.2)^^(14,0)--(14,.2)^^(16,0)--(16,.2)^^(17,0)--(17,.2)^^(18,0)--(18,.2)); draw((1,3)--(1,2.8)^^(2,3)--(2,2.8)^^(3,3)--(3,2.8)^^(4,3)--(4,2.8)^^(6,3)--(6,2.8)^^(7,3)--(7,2.8)^^(8,3)--(8,2.8)^^(9,3)--(9,2.8)^^(10,3)--(10,2.8)^^(11,3)--(11,2.8)^^(12,3)--(12,2.8)^^(13,3)--(13,2.8)^^(14,3)--(14,2.8)^^(16,3)--(16,2.8)^^(17,3)--(17,2.8)^^(18,3)--(18,2.8)); label(&quot;A&quot;, A, S); label(&quot;B&quot;, B, S); label(&quot;C&quot;, C, S); label(&quot;D&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;E&quot;, E, S); label(&quot;A&quot;, F, N); label(&quot;B&quot;, G, N); label(&quot;C&quot;, H, N); label(&quot;D&quot;, I, N); label(&quot;E&quot;, J, N); label(&quot;1970&quot;, (0,3), W); label(&quot;1980&quot;, (0,0), W); label(&quot;0&quot;, (0,1.5)); label(&quot;50&quot;, (5,1.5)); label(&quot;100&quot;, (10,1.5)); label(&quot;150&quot;, (15,1.5)); label(&quot;Population in thousands&quot;, (9,-3)); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"238\" />\n</p><p>On each horizontal line in the figure below, the five large dots indicate the populations of cities <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a70ef3ff6592247a7bb65ba8bb54d724b112890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in the year indicated. \nWhich city had the greatest percentage increase in population from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f83668afd4db1f5a70c7a43dd7d2dd746d2b965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1970$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0987dc78864e4bfa39ea188378f155625e3fb231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1980$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/7/dc75f89eb77595aac1c57b8340ed7b61ec80bce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ A\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ B\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ C\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ D\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We simply have to divide the present population by the original, and whichever one is the largest have the greatest percent change. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />  is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/022cd4734e3f08c43be8ce5352f7c3dc1ba7ad4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50}{40}=1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09920c3af0daa12ac2ec5174e737c31e0f8cec75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/949fb620b9c05770795999878ff0a46749fdc5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{70}{50}=1.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" />. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa04d7a9bcbf1fe3f2037cbc5e763c4b6d2661d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a521cb78982d9e9aa7b8fa25475391d8b203eba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{70} \\approx 1.42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a4f97ce27c2bb251b589501c8f83b8d33612b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{D}$\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14f88e03b14773785e9c9c45dfdff1f79a7efc85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{130}{100}=1.3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5bb2aa78132b4b716cfde4a9136c884d94c753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{E}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd5f533c0559a6e68f849eb6fde5e405443ada3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{160}{120} \\approx 1.33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />. City <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa04d7a9bcbf1fe3f2037cbc5e763c4b6d2661d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" /> has the greatest value, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b317654f901a9c8f56585721a617396d3b050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a h